    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Pirate admirals command entire fleets of pirates. They launch daring ventures, from defying the navies of coastal nations to hunting legendary sea monsters or carving out pirate kingdoms of their own. They may sail from hidden strongholds where they hoard their loot, or keep maps to the places where they buried it, and some ally with the followers of sea gods, underwater peoples, sea monsters, and fellow rogues.</p>",
